@startuml
!include ../themes/proveo.puml
skinparam noteTextAlignment left
' SPEC: _spec/_plans/tutorial-ships.puml
' purpose: punish the jump — F snipe catches ship on f1
' status: ACTIVE — high-value drill; product = StarChess
' covers: apps/starchess/src/tutorial/tutorialScript.config.ts
'         apps/starchess/src/demos/choreography/useShipSnipeCounter.ts
' live spec: _spec/specials/index.puml
'            _spec/apps/starchess/starchess-mode.puml
' Notes are capped at 5 lines x 50 columns; one idea per anchor.
'
' Ally CC h1 HP 1 with g1/f1 free. Enemy ship
' warps to f1 in B phase; player Mecha e4→g2
' then F snipe g2→f1 in the 2nd gas phase.
title Catch post-jump — snipe f1;\nMecha e4 to g2, ship dies on f1

component "lesson config\nCC h1 · Be4 · Ph2 · Ne1\nbBf2 spots f1" as CFG <<app>>
component "shipSnipeCounter\nB warp d5→f1" as CHOREO <<app>>
component "TutorialScreen\nlive engine + gates" as RUN <<app>>
component "**CC lost**\nally HP 0" as LOSE <<error>>

CFG ARROW_MAIN RUN
CHOREO ARROW_QUEUE RUN : B warp to f1
RUN ARROW_MAIN CHOREO : C e4→g2 + F snipe
LOSE ARROW_ERROR RUN : restartWhen 0x lives

note bottom of RUN
  **F snipe fires after the warp lands.**
  B warp lands first, F snipe kills it.
  Win when no ship remains; fail when
  ally CC falls. Hints: f1, then g2.
  Marine h2 holds the flank.
end note

note bottom of CHOREO
  **Enemy warps d5→f1 once on T21.**
  Tier-3 gas affords warp 3 + snipe 2.
  Deterministic per turn; lesson only.
  Generic adjutant stays untouched.
end note

legend bottom
  **Implement this file.**
  ==
  Diff ""TUTORIAL_SCRIPT_CONFIG"" id
  ""king-defense-6"" before new verbs.
  Win no-q; fail ally lives 0.
end legend
@enduml
